MCHL: What do you know about the Fury Project, Lieutenant?

RBTS: Not much. I know it was a superweapon the Cthonians fought over, and I know we're trying to beat the Soviets to discovering how to make it. That's about it.

MCHL: Close. The Furies were a new type of Hadean unit, one they built as a last-ditch effort to win the war. They were sentient - and insane. They went rogue and the Cthonians ended up sacrificing their entire planet to stop them. 

RBTS: Why are you telling me all this?

MCHL: Because you fought them. More importantly, you fought something the rest of us have never seen before. (PAUSE) What's the Vanguard, Lieutenant? 